[quote="Spiff"]

Can we do much theorizing about the Gap without knowing how the SotM story ends in the first place?

[/quote]

&nbsp;

Has not having enough information ever stopped us from theorizing?

&nbsp;

I&#39;d say alien invasion, ala Avengers, but Voss has been doing that. So that leaves me with two theories. The &quot;galactus&quot; theory (something bigger and more powerful than we could have imagined just showed up because of the heroes) or also, a major mystic mojo event, either Apostate succeeds in bringing Hell to Earth or something massively magical comes from the Matriarch angle, like an ancient monster. Gloomweaver and Akash&#39;bhuta seem to cover giant magical monsters though.

&nbsp;

I think I like the Apostate theory, that feels massive enough to be a cataclysmic event beyond what the heroes have dealt with before (Alien Invaders, Giant earth shattering monsters, dying gods, no tacos on taco tuesdays, ect.)

&nbsp;

Random thought, what does Apostate need to open the portal to Hell? Profane Summons he seems to be dripping blood into a glowing bowl, possibly a bowl at Atlantis. What if, crazy speculation, he needs Vanessa&#39;s blood? She&#39;s powerful enough to change reality as shown by the Dreamer and Visionary&#39;s back story, and we have that comment that her dreams &quot;are tainted by another reality&quot;. The child is the center, and it pulls at the heartstrings when little girls are sacrificed for pure evil.
